  "content": "\n\n<p>\n  使 <strong>不死图腾</strong> 在手持时呈现为 <strong>动态的河豚桶</strong>，由 Punchy 与 Refined Buckets 提供支持。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b566fb8def522cb658008a9a49539e9c16678c3_0.webp\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"手持时，河豚桶替代了不死图腾\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lqNBiv3L/images/5d2f2d918a9f0193a9c74b6eaa07606227392e95.gif\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"动画演示：手持时图腾转化为动态河豚桶\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><em>动画演示：背包中的原版图腾，手持时的动态河豚桶</em></p>\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🔗 前置要求</h3>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/refined-buckets\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f5746baecfba25285f8dfeff3f34dedc36b6126.png\"\n         width=\"250\"\n         alt=\"需要 Refined Buckets 资源包\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a26a935a6ed3ee2417064b478f4ff2148be78485.png\"\n         width=\"250\"\n         alt=\"需要 Punchy 模组\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n### ⚙️ 安装方法\n\n1. 安装 **Refined Buckets** 和 **Punchy**\n2. 将此资源包置于 **Refined Buckets 之上**\n\n**故障排除**\n- 如果手持物品出现错位或行为异常，请尝试在 Punchy 设置中禁用 *物品物理效果 (Item Physics)*\n\n### 📜 鸣谢\n\n- Refined Buckets：提供模型与动画支持  \n- Punchy：提供物品动画系统",
